sequenceDiagram
    participant Browser
    participant MedusaAPI as Medusa API
    participant AuthMod as Auth Module
    participant GoogleSvc as GoogleAuthService
    participant StateStore as State Store
    participant Google as Google OAuth API

    Note over Browser,Google: Step 1 — Initiate redirect
    Browser->>MedusaAPI: GET /auth/customer/google
    MedusaAPI->>AuthMod: authenticate(actor_type, "google", req)
    AuthMod->>GoogleSvc: authenticate(req, authIdentityService)
    GoogleSvc->>GoogleSvc: crypto.randomBytes(32) → stateKey
    GoogleSvc->>StateStore: setState(stateKey, { callback_url })
    StateStore-->>GoogleSvc: stored
    GoogleSvc->>GoogleSvc: getRedirect(clientId, callbackUrl, stateKey)\nscope=email profile openid
    GoogleSvc-->>AuthMod: { success: true, location: "https://accounts.google.com/o/oauth2/v2/auth?..." }
    AuthMod-->>MedusaAPI: { location }
    MedusaAPI-->>Browser: 302 Redirect → Google

    Note over Browser,Google: User authenticates on Google
    Browser->>Google: Sign in + Consent
    Google-->>Browser: 302 Redirect → callbackUrl?code=yyy&state=stateKey

    Note over Browser,Google: Step 2 — Handle callback
    Browser->>MedusaAPI: GET /auth/customer/google/callback?code=yyy&state=stateKey
    MedusaAPI->>AuthMod: validateCallback(actor_type, "google", req)
    AuthMod->>GoogleSvc: validateCallback(req, authIdentityService)
    GoogleSvc->>StateStore: getState(stateKey)
    alt state missing or expired
        StateStore-->>GoogleSvc: null
        GoogleSvc-->>AuthMod: { success: false, error: "No state provided, or session expired" }
        AuthMod-->>MedusaAPI: 401
        MedusaAPI-->>Browser: error
    else state valid
        StateStore-->>GoogleSvc: { callback_url }
        GoogleSvc->>Google: POST /token?code&client_id&client_secret&redirect_uri&grant_type=authorization_code
        Google-->>GoogleSvc: { id_token: "<JWT>", access_token, ... }
        GoogleSvc->>GoogleSvc: jwt.decode(id_token) → payload
        alt email_verified === false
            GoogleSvc-->>AuthMod: MedusaError(INVALID_DATA, "Email not verified")
            AuthMod-->>MedusaAPI: 400
            MedusaAPI-->>Browser: error
        else email verified
            GoogleSvc->>GoogleSvc: entity_id = payload.sub\nuserMetadata = { name, email, picture, ... }
            GoogleSvc->>AuthMod: authIdentityService.retrieve({ entity_id })
            alt new user (NOT_FOUND)
                AuthMod-->>GoogleSvc: NOT_FOUND
                GoogleSvc->>AuthMod: authIdentityService.create({ entity_id, user_metadata })
                AuthMod-->>GoogleSvc: authIdentity (new)
            else returning user
                AuthMod-->>GoogleSvc: authIdentity (existing)
            end
            GoogleSvc-->>AuthMod: { success: true, authIdentity }
            AuthMod->>AuthMod: sign JWT
            AuthMod-->>MedusaAPI: { token }
            MedusaAPI-->>Browser: { token }
        end
    end
